docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/C3-swarm-codex.md:154:| 12:00 | Beacon competitors change pricing. A Venture Economist posts three hypotheses; an Experience Designer prepares variants. | Reversible experiment allowed; permanent pricing change requires founder authority. $25 cap. |
