docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/C3-swarm-codex.md:167:| **Strongest: portfolio resilience.** A dead session loses a lease, not the organisation’s plan. | Work resumes from durable evidence and obligations. |
docs/vision-v3/r1-concepts/C3-swarm-codex.md:171:| **Weakness: popularity can masquerade as truth.** | Reinforce through external outcomes, preserve dissent, reserve counterevidence capacity and track evidence lineage. |
