 that answer a prose finding.","F6A-01":"No file-and-check pair is recorded here for it. Classified conservatively by F6R-01: the recheck measured that THREE of the committed 37 had no repair anywhere and did not establish that the other 34 did, so `answered_elsewhere` carries only the findings whose answering file and check this package can name. A finding moves out of this set by someone naming them, never by assertion.","F6A-02":"No file-and-check pair is recorded here for it. Classified conservatively by F6R-01: the recheck measured that THREE of the committed 37 had no repair anywhere and did not establish that the other 34 did, so `answered_elsewhere` carries only the findings whose answering file and check this package can name. A finding moves out of this set by someone naming them, never by assertion.","F6A-03":"No file-and-check pair is recorded here for it. Classified conservatively by F6R-01: the recheck measured that THREE of the committed 37 had no repair anywhere and did not establish that the other 34 did, so `answered_elsewhere` carries only the findings whose answering file and check this package can name. A finding moves out of this set by someone naming them, never by assertion.","F6A-04":"No file-and-check pair is recorded here for it. Classified conservatively by F6R-01: the recheck measured that THREE of the committed 37 had no repair anywhere and did not establish that the other 34 did, so `answered_elsewhere` carries only the findings whose answering file and check this package can name. A finding moves out of this set by someone naming them, never by assertion.","F6A-05":"No file-and-check pair is recorded here for it. Classified conservatively by F6R-01: the recheck measured that THREE of the committed 37 had no repair anywhere and did not establish that the other 34 did, so `answered_elsewhere` carries only the findings whose answering file and check this package can name. A finding moves out of this set by someone naming them, never by a