docs/vision-system/planning/specification/12-scope-lifecycle-traceability.md:48:**SPECIFICATION.** D01–D15 make interactions testable: expired idempotency, restored stale authority, correct outcomes with unauthorized process, aggregate exposure, misleading rationales, competence versus ownership, residual duties, semantic/denominator drift, poisoned summaries, provider changes, compromised capture, billing fallback, stale policy applicability, loss of owner capacity and conflicting benchmark caption/table claims. They preserve the research lane attribution in the original [discovered register](../../coverage/discovered.json). Their precise system mechanisms live in 01–08 and the consolidated schemas; this catalog adds no second grant, acceptance, deletion or recovery authority.
